    <string name="how_it_works_sub">Shift, recording, pocket mode, falls and sealing</string>
    <string name="got_it">Got it</string>
    <string name="guide_1_t">1. Shift = standby</string>
    <string name="guide_1">While on shift the camera runs in the background (screen off too) and keeps only the last seconds. Nothing is saved until you record.</string>
    <string name="guide_2_t">2. Recording</string>
    <string name="guide_2">One tap on REC, the volume-up key, the floating button, the notification, a shake or your voice. The video also includes the seconds before. To stop, hold the button – so a bump can\'t end a recording.</string>
    <string name="guide_3_t">3. Pocket mode</string>
    <string name="guide_3">Black screen at minimum brightness; touches do nothing. The volume-up key still starts and stops. Double-tap to leave.</string>
    <string name="guide_4_t">4. Vibration instead of looking</string>
    <string name="guide_4">Long = recording. Two short = stopped. Three short = saved and sealed.</string>
    <string name="guide_5_t">5. Fall detection</string>
    <string name="guide_5">A fall followed by lying still starts recording by itself. With an emergency contact set, a beeping countdown appears and then a call is placed.</string>
    <string name="guide_6_t">6. Sealed evidence</string>
    <string name="guide_6">Every video gets a SHA-256 fingerprint the moment it\'s saved, and is locked. On the recording screen you can verify it wasn\'t changed. Sharing includes the full fingerprint.</string>
    <string name="ob1_title">A body camera that also remembers what came before</string>
    <string name="ob1_body">Wear the phone on your chest. Shomer buffers in the background and saves only when you decide – together with the seconds before.</string>
    <string name="ob_p1">On standby all shift, even with the screen off</string>
    <string name="ob_p2">Every recording is sealed with SHA-256 and locked as evidence</string>
    <string name="ob2_title">Built for the field</string>
    <string name="ob_p3">Volume-up key or a shake – no need to look at the screen</string>
    <string name="ob_p4">Pocket mode: a black screen that ignores touches</string>
    <string name="ob_p5">Distinct vibrations for start, stop and saved</string>
    <string name="ob_p6">Fall detection with an emergency call</string>
    <string name="ob3_title">Who is recording?</string>
    <string name="ob3_body">Your name or badge number is stamped in the corner of every video, with date, time and location. You can change it in Settings.</string>
